  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e07-scene-08",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "娱乐报道与营销单  (Master's Degrees and Marketing Deals)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "bianbian": "边边"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After work, Bu Xiaogu meets reporter Bianbian expecting tough questions about Li Mingji, only to discover Bianbian is probing Xingtian's executive rivalry for a very different business reason. Listen to their Mandarin banter first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢，有关于李铭基先生的事，你需要问什么就问我吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "李铭基的事你们内部已经统一口径了，问了你也只是背公关部的稿子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我今天想聊的是更有意思的事，你们星天内部是什么结构啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "星天以节目制作为核心，却有四个制作部，总编室的淳于乔和其他人到底谁占大局？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "边边先生，您是平时写文章写多了，想象力越来越丰富吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您说的这些事情都太复杂了，我真的都没听懂。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您要是想写娱乐新闻，也要注重事情的真实性，不能怎么好玩就怎么写吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你挺厉害啊，我以为吓唬一下助理小姑娘是个容易的突破口，没想到大意了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "边边先生，只让你写文章真是太屈才了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你说得对，我们路条网最主要的业务不是娱乐报道，是营销，知道什么是营销吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "知道啊，我是大众传播的硕士。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "失敬啊，我是新闻学和艺术管理双硕士，我看咱俩挺有缘的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "跟你说实话吧，写报道只是个由头，主要目的是帮路条网拿到星天的营销单。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你就跟我透个底吧，他们两边你觉得谁能赢？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢，有关于李铭基先生的事，你需要问什么就问我吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you; regarding Mr Li Mingji, go ahead and ask me whatever you need.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "李铭基的事你们内部已经统一口径了，问了你也只是背公关部的稿子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingtian already unified its line on Li Mingji; asking would just get me the PR script.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我今天想聊的是更有意思的事，你们星天内部是什么结构啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Today I want to chat about something more interesting: how is Xingtian structured inside?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "星天以节目制作为核心，却有四个制作部，总编室的淳于乔和其他人到底谁占大局？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingtian centres on production yet has four units — between Chun Yuqiao and the others, who holds sway?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "边边先生，您是平时写文章写多了，想象力越来越丰富吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Bianbian, has writing so many articles made your imagination run wild?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您说的这些事情都太复杂了，我真的都没听懂。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everything you are describing is far too complicated; I truly do not follow.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您要是想写娱乐新闻，也要注重事情的真实性，不能怎么好玩就怎么写吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you write entertainment news, you should still value accuracy rather than writing whatever sounds fun.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你挺厉害啊，我以为吓唬一下助理小姑娘是个容易的突破口，没想到大意了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are sharp; I thought rattling a young assistant would be an easy opening, yet I misjudged.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "边边先生，只让你写文章真是太屈才了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Bianbian, having you merely write articles is a waste of your talent.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你说得对，我们路条网最主要的业务不是娱乐报道，是营销，知道什么是营销吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are right — Lutiao News mainly does marketing rather than reporting; do you know marketing?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "知道啊，我是大众传播的硕士。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Of course I do; I hold a master's degree in mass communication.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "失敬啊，我是新闻学和艺术管理双硕士，我看咱俩挺有缘的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My respects — I hold dual master's degrees in journalism and arts management; we click well.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "跟你说实话吧，写报道只是个由头，主要目的是帮路条网拿到星天的营销单。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Honestly, the article is just a pretext; my real goal is winning Xingtian's marketing contract for Lutiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你就跟我透个底吧，他们两边你觉得谁能赢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Give me an inside tip — between the two camps, who do you think will win?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢，有关于李铭基先生的事，你需要问什么就问我吧。",
